usage: sjaracne.py local [-h] -e FILE -g FILE [-k INT | -pc FLOAT] [-pb FLOAT]
                         [-M {pchip}] [-d INT] [-c DIR] [-n INT]
                         [-sf FLOAT | -sm INT] -o DIR -tmp DIR [-s]

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  -e FILE, --exp-file FILE
                        Path to an expression matrix file, row indexes are
                        used as thenodes in the network.
  -g FILE, --hub-genes FILE
                        Path to a file containing a list of symbols to be
                        considered as hub genes.
  -k INT, --min-recurrence INT
                        Minimum number of distinct resampled networks
                        containing an edge; default: 6.
  -pc FLOAT, --p-value-consensus FLOAT
                        Deprecated legacy normal-approximation P-value
                        threshold for the consensus network.
  -pb FLOAT, --p-value-bootstrap FLOAT
                        Per-resample MI probability: required explicitly with
                        -M pchip; legacy default: 1e-7.
  -M {pchip}, --apmi-null-model {pchip}
                        Opt in to bundled experimental PCHIP MI cutoffs;
                        requires depth 40. Defaults remain legacy affine.
  -d INT, --depth INT   maximum partitioning depth.
  -c DIR, --config-dir DIR
                        Directory containing ARACNe configuration files. Use
                        default configs if not provided.
  -n INT, --bootstrap-num INT
                        Number of resampled networks to generate (legacy
                        option name).
  -sf FLOAT, --subsample-fraction FLOAT
                        Fraction of eligible observations sampled without
                        replacement in each network; default: 0.8.
  -sm INT, --subsample-size INT
                        Exact number of eligible observations sampled without
                        replacement in each network.
  -o DIR, --output-dir DIR
                        Path to final output directory.
  -tmp DIR, --tmpdir-prefix DIR
                        Specify tmp path,default is /tmp.
  -s, --serial          run cwltool in serial mode
